<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Kolosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kolosa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">NWER NYI POL NYONO TV</para>
  <para style="mt2">ANEB ERO BA LI GO</para>
  <para style="mt1">KOLOSA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Me Pol ji koro Esowo, á yehk-m no, n li ntiingetib a Kraist Jisos, awahr a Timoti mmonannee ejahre, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />e kpꞌnyono nwer nyia tv aneb Esowo ba li go Kolosa, bo jio ji li abonanee go ejang bi Kraist, ba kpi ekakesehk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Nong, Esowo Nso ejahre ka-n nnoobo, a elkoono.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ero bi Pol jo kak ka Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Ngare anyehng anyehng nyi e lꞌkak ero ka-n, e kpo kak Esowo saam, ye ji li nde no Ntul ewahre Jisos Kraist. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Tibre wahr ebwuk bade ekakesehk ejahne ji ń kpꞌtoono Jisos Kraist, fere tob wuk ana aneb Esowo kpee kpo kor-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 1:15</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Tibre ekunukpu ejahne li go nsol nyi Esowo kuuru no bum-n go ejahbetul Esowo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:24-25</char></note> nsol nyio nyi ḿ ma tohko wuk, eji bo tong-n alum nya li go etingitingi, nya li nnoobo etib. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Etib bia bi bo ma ba tiingi go egahne kpꞌyeere rehng go ejang njini abehng abehng, fere kpꞌkake elfuulu. Ano wo fvfo ma tob lim go egahne ellong, bomo gona efung bi ń gbo mbang wuk, fere kahn nnoobo nyi Esowo, jang jang ana li no go etingitingi.<verse eid="COL 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Tibre ń kpili goji Epafras ji li nkakesehk a nlokeltum no Kraist ka-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 4:12</char></note> Á kpo lim eltum ana wahr, ye ji kpo sahb kor-r kor. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Ye wo ma-r tong bade elkoro enahne ni ń kpi no, ni Etingi Etohko ma-n ka.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Bomo go efung bi e wuku bada nsol nyio, e ka tiki rahke ero akake ka-n, fere jo gboongo Esowo, eji ń lꞌgbal go elkahne ni Etingi Etohko kpo ka, fere tob jol anebe ngbere, fere kahn mbang enye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 1:16-17</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />E kpo kak ero re, wahn lim eljini ni bahke fuumu a ni Ntul a Jisos, ni kpo kor-e ngare anyehng anyehng, wahn fere jo kab akab go nnoobo eltum anehng anehng ni ń kpꞌlimi, fere jo gbal go elkahne ni Esowo, <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />fere bel eko ji biingi a egburu nsahm nyi Esowo, nyio nyi ellub ene, eji ń lꞌmal elkpuumu, jo kpooro go eyebatahng, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />fere jo kak Esowo saam, ye jio ji ma-r ka nsahm re wahr tob li elkv ene semme a aneb Esowo bako ba ma tob li etul bꞌnehm ana wahr, bio bi ellennge.<verse eid="COL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Á ma-r tahre yehke go eju bio bi ejannge, feere a nahre go ejahbetul jio ji Mmon ewe no kpo kor-e sꞌsehng, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />ye jio ji ma-r fak yake, fere tahm ka-r go egahre abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 1:7</char></note><verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne awo li Kraist?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kraist wo li efꞌtu ji Esowo bi nne lꞌki-e ma nyehn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 1:3</char></note> Ye wo li nne no gbo mbang jini, njini kehm jolo. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Esowo ko nsahm nyi Jisos Kraist, lim nsol kpee nyi li go elbung, a nyi li ndi, nsol nyi e kpꞌnyehne go amahr, a nsol nyi e kil elnyehne go amahr, a nti etul, a afiladi, a atul, go atubesi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:3</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Á tohko jol, ejum ajehng ajehng kehm jolo. Ye wo kpꞌwahnge nsol kpee kpꞌjene go elkoono. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Ye wo li esi ji ngubjing enye nyi li aneb ero.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 1:22</char></note> Ye wo li mbomannahb. Ye wo li ngbokambang a nne no gbo mbang nyahme go elkv, eji á lꞌjol ngbokambang go ejum ajehng ajehng, fere jol ntubesi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 1:5</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Tibre jo yebe Esowo atahng sehng re, á rod ellub ene kpee, ba woomo Kraist go atahng. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Esowo sehnge go ege, ko nsol kpee, feere a nyi go ege, ba jol go elkoono anehng, afi nsol nyi jolo go ndi, afi jolo go elbung. Tibre alung ma Jisos kpo go ekros ma wahnge Esowo ma lim nsol kpee jol go elkoono.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 1:10; 1 Jon 2:2</char></note><verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Wuku wuku ń jolo ajahmjahm go esamahr bi Esowo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:12</char></note> fere jol anebekv ebe go egahna ntir, fere jo lim abꞌbi nsol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 5:10</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Anv, tib go elkv ni Jisos kpo go ngubjing ni wahnge Esowo ma-n lim re wahn jol go elkoono awahn a ne, eji á lꞌlim-n, ń jol saang, kꞌbel ebꞌbi ajehng ajehng, nne awohng awohng ki-n jo ma ka ebi, á fere ko-n ba a nahne go ege esamahr. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Esowo bahk-n limi ano, ń lꞌfere soro asi go ege a mbang, fere yiimi tꞌtahne, kꞌren, kꞌyehke ekunukpu ejahne goji Esowo, ye ji ń wuku alum enye nya bo ma bung tong nne awohng awohng go njini, nyao nya me Pol ma jol nlokeltum.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eltum ni Pol jo lim ka aneb ero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Eltim kp-m yebe go egame erem bi n kpꞌnyehne tib go egahne esi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 3:13</char></note> Tibre n kpꞌgohro nyehn erem bi Kraist nyehne no sa go egama ngubjing, tib go esi ji ngubjing enye nyi li aneb ero. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Me n fere jol nlokeltum abo. Tibre Esowo bi ka-m eltum nia re me n lim ka-n. Eltum nia li re, me n lim ane kahn alum Esowo gbalee. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Alum Esowo nyaa li ejum ji Esowo behre no mahne mahne re nne awohng awohng kꞌnyehn, anv, yeblennge ka ane ebe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 16:25-26</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />ba á ma yehke re bo kahn afang nya ellub ni wob go ejum ji Esowo behre mahne mahne, ji li Kraist ji wob go egahne atahng, wahn ji li ane ba ki li Jus. Ye wo wahnge ekunukpu ejahne li re, ḿ bahke jolo go ellub ni Esowo.<verse eid="COL 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Ye wo, e kpo bung bada ne, fere jo rehke nne awohng awohng, fere jo tib-e ajoobo nsol nya elkahne, eji e lꞌko nne awohng awohng ba ka Esowo ana nne no ma gbal go ejang bi Kraist. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Nsol nyia nyi wahnge n kpo gbehd, fere jo nꞌnok go nsahm nyi Kraist ka-m no, nyi li egburu nsahm go egame atahng.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />N kpꞌsebe re wahn kahn ana n kpꞌnoko go eltum ni n kpꞌlimi ka-n, fere lim ka ane ba li go Laodisea, a ane bako kpee ba kal-m tob nyehn, <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />eji bo lꞌbob eltim, elkoro wahng, bo jol ajehng ana elꞌlehke kpehre a ntem, fere fang go elkahne, kꞌjo bel nfaabe anyehng anyehng, fere kahn ejum ji li mbehr mbehr ji Esowo, ji li Kraist. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Goji Kraist wo Esowo behre afang nya elkahne ene kpee, ni á kpꞌkahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 1:24,30</char></note><verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />N kp-n tongo nsol nyia, eji nne awohng awohng lꞌki-n nehm go efoolo nnyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 2:23; 2 Tim 3:5</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Jol eji n ki lꞌli a nahne go ngubjing, me n noa a nahne go etohko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 5:3</char></note> Atahng kp-m yebe, eji m ma seb kahn ana ń kpꞌjene go nseenge, fere yiimi tꞌtahne go ekakesehk ji ń kpꞌtoono Kraist.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo gberen elnahne, eji nnene lꞌki-n taare afang nya Kraist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Anv, eji ḿ ma ko Kraist Jisos kak go egahne atahng ana Ntul ewahne, jo jenen a ne! <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Rehnen alohk go ege ana eti kpo rehne alohk go ndi, wahn fere gbal go ekakesehk, yiimi tꞌtahne, kꞌtiki yake mbang nyi Jisos, ana bo tib-n no, wahn fere gbal go saam akake.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Jo gberen elnahne, eji nne lꞌkꞌrannge ntir atahng enyahne go elkahne nehka nehka ni ane leeme goji babnde ebo, ni ki li ni Kraist, fere nehm-n go awak nya atohko nya li go njini nyia. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Tibre Esowo ebtahm kpee woomo Jisos go ege atahng. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Owo wahnge ḿ ma bel elkpin kpee, eji ń sehnge go ege, ye ji li ntubesi no atul kpee, a abafiladi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 1:21</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Go ege wo, bo yehk-n nrur, nrur nyehka nyehka sang, nrur ayehke nyi Kraist nyi, nyi lohngo re, nne bahke ludu eso jio ji abiafem tub go.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 2:29; 1 Pit 3:21</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Eji ḿ bele ewohngalahb, lohngo re, bo ma-n kpa kak a Kraist. Ewohngalahb ji ḿ bele no ebtob lohng re, wahn ebnyahme a Kraist tib go egahne eltaame, tibre wahn ebtaame tv nsahm nyi Esowo bi nyahm-e go elkv,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:4</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />wahn ji jolo ane ba kpo no tib go egahne abiafem, a nrur nyi ń ki yehke, Esowo ma-n lim re wahn jol go elkpin a Kraist, eji á ma tahm ka-r go egahre abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:1,5</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Yebyake mbong nyi e bel-e no ka-r, nyi e jol tiki gal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 18:27</char></note> Á yake ka-r, eji á rodo nwer a mbong nyio kum go ekros.<verse eid="COL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Go ekros wo, á ga atul kpee, a abafiladi, fere taare bo nsahm, riki bo ndon go elkab ane, fere kunu bo akpade.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Ano wo fvfo ń lꞌkꞌtaame nne awohng awohng jehke ntahm ka-n bada nsol nyi ń kpo li, fere jo wo, afi jolo abarebare afung, afi jolo efung bi ebareka ma lahm, afi fere jolo efung Esabat.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:8-11</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Nsol nyia kpee li go elfoongo ni nsol nyi kpꞌbake go esꞌsong. Atingitingi nsol li goji Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 8:5; 10:1</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Nong, nne awohng awohng ki-n were taare eltuuru enahne, ye jio ji kpo rede elne ana koro yefono antahng, fere jo kak enjel, jo yiimi go nsol nyi á kil elkahne. Elkohn nne noo kpo bum elne wahre wahre mbol mbol, tib á kpo tir ntir nyehka nyehka nyi ane kpo tir. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Elkohn nne noo ebyake eljabbe Kraist ji li esi, ye ji kpo le ngubjing nyi kpi akon, a ajahb, nya kpo lim ngubjing jol anyehng, eji lꞌgbal agbal ana koro Esowo re gbal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:15-16</char></note><verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atahm nya ane kpo tib nya foongo atingitingi atahm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Wahn ebkpo a Kraist, fere lohng go elwo ni atohko nya njini nyia. Jen ji wahnge elkpin enahne li ana, are ń kpeke wob go njini? Jen ji wahnge ń kpo bum atahm nyaa ana, nya bungu re,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:3,9</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Kana jo kooro nsol nyio! Kana jo li nsol nyio! Kana jo lak abo go nsol nyio!”? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Nsol nyia kpee lohngem ejumjum. Ana li no, ano wo bahke toono o tan. Atahm nyaa ana, atahm nya ane fumu no, fere kpꞌtibi nya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 15:9</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Etingitingi, atahm nyaa kpꞌfoongo nya nno, eji kpꞌtibi re, ane jo kak Esowo go bo a nsahm, ana koro bofono, fere jo rede elbo ana koro bo, fere jo bib a ngubjing ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 18:12</char></note> Nsol nyia kpee, nsehng anyehng anyehng limm. Nyao bo kpo lim re, nob a ngubjing ebo, ana bo kpꞌsebe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 4:1-3</char></note><verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s">Nkꞌkulu elkpin, a elkpin ni nfenfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Lꞌjol ano re wahn ebnyahme go elkv a Kraist, yehken ntim enyahne kunu go nsol nyi li go ejahbetul Esowo, edi ji Kraist jehk no go eboblum bi Esowo. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Kunen amahr enyahne go nsol nyio ona, kana kunu go nsol nyi njini nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 6:33</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Tibre wahn ebkpo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:2,6</char></note> Bobbehr elkpin enahne goji Kraist ji li goji Esowo. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Kraist wo li elkpin enahre. Ngare nyi á lꞌlohng ba, owo wahn bahke tob lohng, jol gbul gbul gbuul, fere tob tib ellub ene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:42-43</char></note><verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Owo fvfo nobo re wahn wul nsol njini nyi wob go egahne atahng, ana anebkal akono, nsol nyi ki li saang, nsol nyi kpo kor ane go ellimi, abꞌbi nya kpo melle ane go bo a ntim, ebaaramahr go nsol ane, ji li ana eblom ajomo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:13</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Tibre nsol nyia nyi bahke wahnge erakatahng ji Esowo gbo tub ane ba kil-e elwuku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:6</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Wuku wuku ń jo tob toono mbang nyio, fere jo lim nsol nyio.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Anv, yaken nsol nyia kpee, ana erakatahng, eltim amaange, eblum alimi, ane asuku, abi aka atubu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Kana jo kiimi afahnge tong atemtem, tibre wahn ebyake nkꞌkulu elkpin, ń nehme kpe lim eljini nio. <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Wahn ebfere bel elkpin nfenfe ni Esowo bahke jo lim-n, ń jo jol nfenfe nfenfe ngare anyehng anyehng, tete ḿ biingi a ye jio ji lim-n no, ń fere kahn-e kpee. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Go ege ejang, elyaange anehng anehng limm, afi jolo Grik, afi jolo Jus, afi jolo ane ba ma yehke nrur, afi jolo ane ba kala yehke nrur, afi jolo aneb ekulugbe, afi jolo akpak, afi jolo aju, afi jolo ane ba ki li aju. Kraist wo li ejum ajehng ajehng, ye jꞌnehm wo wob go atahng ane bao kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:28</char></note><verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Wahn ane ba koro Esowo, á yehk-n no re wahn jol ejahne ejahne. Fvfo, belen nsol nyi kpo fuumu aneb Esowo, ana ndon, nnoobo eljini, eltim ni li rede rede, eljolo soom, go elkpooro. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Jo kpuumen ka atemtem. Ń lꞌbel ebi bade atemtem, jo yaken ka atemtem. Ana Kraist ma tahm ka-n, tob jo tahmen ka atemtem. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Jo belen elkoro budu go nsol nyia kpee. Tibre elkoro ni li ana nlehke mi bo kpo ko tuuru nsol, fere jol elkpulkpu anehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 13:8-10</char></note><verse eid="COL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Nong, elkoono ni Kraist ko nji go egahna ntim. Tibre Esowo ma-r yehke re wahr jol go elkoono na anehng, a ngubjing anyehng, fere jo kak-e saam.<verse eid="COL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Nong, alum nya Kraist jol a nahne go egahne ellong gbꞌgbal. Jo tiben, wahn fere jo rehke atemtem go elkahne ni Esowo kpee, eji ń kpo yim ase Saams, fere yim ase ero, fere yim ase nyako nya etohko. Jo yimen go egahne atahng ka Esowo, a saam akake. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Ejum ajehng ajehng ji ń lꞌlim, afi jolo elbungu, afi fere jolo ellimi, jo limen go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos Kraist, a saam akake ji e kpo kak Esowo Nde sehng goji Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:31</char></note><verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eljini nfenfe ni nne bahke jo lim go ege a nlaaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Anebkal, jo woomen alum ebahne go elwo, tibre nyao nya fuumu re wahn lim, eji ń li ka Jehova.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 3:1</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Aneblum, nong, akal ebahne jo kor-n. Kana jo marre a bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 3:7</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Abonse, jo wuken babnso ejahne, a babnne ejahne go mbang anyehng anyehng, tibre jia ji kpo kor Jehova.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 6:1</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Afono abon, kana jo bib a abon ebahne, eji ntim lꞌkꞌjo woono bo. <verse eid="COL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Aju, jo kaken babnso ejahne go nsol kpee. Kana jo lim eltum ngare nyi nne kp-n nyehne wo wo, tib eji á lꞌjo tehk-n. Jo limen eltum go eltim anehng, tib go elfahle ni ń kpꞌfahle Nso ejahne no li go ero.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 2:18</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Eltum anehng anehng ni ń kpꞌlimi, jo limen a ntim a ntim enyahne kpee ana ane ba kpꞌloko Jehova, ba kil loko ane. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Jo buumen re, Jehova wo bahk-n tuuru, fere ka-n nsol elehke elkv enyahne. Tibre ń kpꞌloko Ntul a Kraist. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Nne no kpo lim abꞌbi, bo bahk-e tuuru ana á limi abꞌbi, tibre Esowo kpehme rang nnene.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Babnde aju, jo filen aju enyahne nob nob go mbang anyehng anyehng, wahn fere jo buumu re, n tob kpi Nde go ejahbetul Esowo.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erehke ji Pol gohro rehke aneb ero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Belen ekakesehk go ero akake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 5:17</char></note> Jo kunen ekpu ana ń kpꞌkake ero, wahn fere jo kak Esowo saam. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Jo tob kaken ero fvfo ka-r, eji Esowo lꞌlennge mbang ka-r, e jo bung akpokosi alum nya Kraist tong ane. Tibre alum nyao nya wahnge n wob go agbekobo. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Jo kaken ero, eji n lꞌjo bung go mbang nyi bahke jo lennge alum Esowo, ana fuumu re me m bung. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Ń lꞌwoomo go ellong ane ba ki li aneb Esowo, jo bangen! Kana jo rannge ngare enyahne mbol mbol!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:15-16</char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Jo bungen yebe yebe ngare anyehng anyehng, wahn jo semme akang, eji ń lꞌmal jo faange nne awohng awohng nnooba nfaange.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:29; Mak 9:50</char></note><verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atem Pol ba bo jo lim eltum ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Mmonanne ejahre Tikikus ji kpo sahb kor-r kor bahk-n tongo kpee bada name. Á li nkakesehk a nlokeltum no Jehova, no kpo tob lim eltum nꞌnehm ana wahr. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Ano wo wahnge n tum-e tv-n, eji á lꞌba nyehn ana ń kpꞌlimi, fere kak-n eltim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 6:21-22</char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />N tumu ye, fere tum Onesimus,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fai 10-11</char></note> ji li nkakesehk a mmonanne ejahre no kpo kor-r sꞌsehng, ye ji wob go egahne ellong. Bo bahk-n tongo ejum ajehng ajehng ji kpꞌlimi ga.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristarkus ji e wob ngbekobo ano kp-n kake nnyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 19:29; 27:2</char></note> Ano wo fvfo Mak,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 15:36-41; 2 Tim 4:11</char></note> ji li mmon a Barnabas kp-n tob kak nnyo. M ma-n tohko tong bada ne re, á lꞌba go egahne, wahn vvr-e. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Jisos ji bo kpo lung-e re Justus kp-n tob kak nnyo. Ane baa ana ba li aneb Jus, ba e kpo lim eltum ano a bo, ni Jehova, a etul ebe. Bo jo kak-m eltim sehng.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafras ji lohng go egahne ellong kp-n tob kak nnyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 1:7-8</char></note> Á tob li nlokeltum a Jisos Kraist, no kpo buum-n go ege ero bi á kpo kono elkake ngare anyehng anyehng. Á kpo kak ero, jo nok re wahn yiimi tꞌtahne, fere gbal, jo kahn ana ḿ bahke jo toono mbang nyi Esowo, kꞌbel nfaabe anyehng anyehng. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />N kpo yiim-e ntianse re á jo limi eltum sehng ka-n, fere tob jo lim ka ane ba li go Laodisea, a ane ba li go Hierapolis.<verse eid="COL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luk ji li nlimakahm no kpo kor-r sꞌsehng, ye a Demas, bo kp-n tob kak nnyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tim 4:10-11; Fai 24</char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Kaken abonanee ba li go Laodisea nnyo ka-m, wahn tob kak Nimfa nnyo, nnenkal no aneb ero bandiki kpo song kono go ege etahk.<verse eid="COL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Ń lꞌlung nwer nyia mal, tumen tv aneb ero ba li go Laodisea,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 3:14</char></note> bo tob lung fvfo, wahn tob lung nwer nyi aneb Laodisea bahke tumu tv-n.<verse eid="COL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Tongen Arkipus re á jo lim eltum ni Jehova m-e ka go nseenga nseenge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fai 2</char></note><verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Me Pol, mefono wo kpꞌnyono nnyo mia mi n kp-n kake go egame ebo. Kana yini agbekobo enyame! Nong, nnoobo nyi Esowo jol a nahne.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>